"icon:lock[title=Fixed at build time] [[quarkus-vertx_quarkus-vertx-native-"
"transport]] [.property-path]##link:#quarkus-vertx_quarkus-vertx-native-"
"transport[`+++quarkus.vertx.native-transport+++`]##\n"
"config_property_copy_button:+++quarkus.vertx.native-transport+++[]\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"[.description]\n"
"--\n"
"Whether and how strictly native transport should be used.\n"
"\n"
"Supported values:\n"
"\n"
" * `disabled` - Do not use native transport (default). Vert.x always uses "
"Java NIO.\n"
" * `if-available` - Use native transport if available, fall back to Java NIO "
"otherwise.\n"
" * `required` - Require native transport. If the transport dependency is "
"missing, the build fails. If the native library cannot load at runtime, the "
"application fails to start.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Environment variable: env_var_with_copy_button:"
"+++QUARKUS_VERTX_NATIVE_TRANSPORT+++[]\n"
"--"
msgstr ""

