"\n"
"\n"
"[.description]\n"
"--\n"
"The executor growth resistance.\n"
"\n"
"A resistance factor applied after the core pool is full; values applied here "
"will cause that fraction of submissions to create new threads when no idle "
"thread is available. A value of `0.0f` implies that threads beyond the core "
"size should be created as aggressively as threads within it; a value of `1."
"0f` implies that threads beyond the core size should never be created.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Environment variable: env_var_with_copy_button:"
"+++QUARKUS_VERTX_GROWTH_RESISTANCE+++[]\n"
"--"
